+                    "Cannot remove violation file '%s' because it is outside the store folder", source.getFileName()));
+        }
+        Files.delete(target);
+        if (!target.equals(source) && Files.exists(source, LinkOption.NOFOLLOW_LINKS)) {
+            Files.delete(source);
+        }
+    }
